"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids March to April came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years. In 2025, October to November finished at 44% of normal on that middle. So far in 2026, April to May sits at 232% and May to June at 243% on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 9731 at 40%.</p>"}
